    "description": {
      "value": "<p data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3037\"><em data-start=\"3023\" data-end=\"3037\">(14th Level)</em></p><p data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3057\"><em data-start=\"3039\" data-end=\"3057\">\u201cNo. Remove it.\u201d</em></p><p data-start=\"3059\" data-end=\"3143\">When you cast a removal or negation manifestation, you may massively enhance its scope once.</p><p data-start=\"3145\" data-end=\"3153\">You may:</p><ul data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3306\"><li data-start=\"3155\" data-end=\"3203\"><p data-start=\"3157\" data-end=\"3203\">Bypass one immunity or resistance to negation.</p></li><li data-start=\"3204\" data-end=\"3256\"><p data-start=\"3206\" data-end=\"3256\">Extend the removal across multiple linked effects.</p></li><li data-start=\"3257\" data-end=\"3306\"><p data-start=\"3259\" data-end=\"3306\">Force the suppression through layered defenses.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3308\" data-end=\"3330\">Immediate consequence:</p><ul data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3379\"><li data-start=\"3332\" data-end=\"3354\"><p data-start=\"3334\" data-end=\"3354\">risk the misfire ladder.</p></li><li data-start=\"3355\" data-end=\"3379\"><p data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3379\">a misfire at the top of the ladder is guaranteed.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3381\" data-end=\"3408\">This is not clever editing.</p><p data-start=\"3410\" data-end=\"3453\">This is tearing a paragraph out of reality.</p><p data-start=\"3455\" data-end=\"3481\">The universe will respond.</p><p><em>Recosted 2026-08-23: this ability's earlier economy (Civic Charge / Strain / Resonance / Leverage / Administrative Pressure) is retired \u2014 everything now runs on Surge, Clarity, Noise, and the misfire ladder. The ability dialog's cost line is the truth; ledgers named here are narrative, GM-adjudicated, never a tracked pool.</em></p>",
